//
// Step type definitions
//
// Index        : This is the index of the combobox item defined in macros.inp
// Name         : This is the name used to refer to the thread in stairs.dat 
// Material     : Material for thread
// h            : height of tread
// b            : width of thread
// j            : vertical bolt position from top of thread
// k            : horizontal position of first bolt from thread edge
// l            : horizontal distance between bolts
// m            : length of longhole in thread (not used)
// bolt         : bolt diameter (0 diameter creates no holes in stringer)
// fu           : vertical chamfer dimension left
// fl           : horizontal chamfer dimension left
// bu           : vertical chamfer dimension right
// bl           : horizontal chamfer dimension right
// extralen     : Additional material thickness for bolt length calculation (thickness of end plate in thread)
// din          : Bolt assembly standard
//
//          |------------------ b -----------------|
//     ---  oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo   ---
//     |    o                                      o     |
//     j    o---k---|--------l--------|            o     |
//     |    o                        ___           o     |
//     -----o------ O               O___O          o--   h
//       |   o     bolt                           o  |   |
//       fu   o                     | m |        o   bu  |
//       |     o                                o    |   |
//       ---     oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo     -- ---
//          |-fl-|                            |-bl-|
//
//   Name                 Material   h       b       j      k      l       m      bolt   fu     fl     bu     bl  extralen  din
//  
//d  s                    s          lf      lf      lf     lf     lf      lf     d      lf     lf     lf     lf     lf     s

